==============================================================================
dsh-im
==============================================================================

dsh-im (https://github.com/xmanrui/dsh-im)
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 xmanrui

  - ds-bot/src/host/im/platforms/telegram.js follows the Telegram Bot API
    mapping of dsh-im's telegram channel (long polling, getFile downloads,
    callback queries, and its send/edit calls), and
    ds-bot/src/host/im/format.js follows the Markdown chunking of
    src/channels/shared/markdown-chunks.mjs and telegram-rich-message.mjs
    there: code fences stay whole where they fit and are re-fenced when
    they must be split.
  - ds-bot/src/host/im/platforms/discord.js follows the gateway and REST
    mapping of dsh-im's discord channel (src/channels/discord/discord-runtime.mjs
    and discord-api.mjs): resume with session_id and resume_gateway_url,
    component presses answered by a deferred update, message chunking.
  - ds-bot/src/host/im/platforms/slack.js follows the Socket Mode handling of
    src/channels/slack/slack-runtime.mjs and slack-api.mjs: every envelope
    ACKed, disconnect frames reconnect, message and app_mention events, and
    file downloads from url_private.
  - ds-bot/src/host/im/platforms/weixin.js follows the iLink mapping of
    src/channels/weixin/weixin-api.mjs and weixin-controller.mjs: the QR
    login poll, getupdates with the get_updates_buf cursor, context_token
    per user, typing tickets, and the AES image download.
  - ds-bot/src/host/im/platforms/wecom.js follows the aibot frame mapping of
    src/channels/wecom/wecom-runtime.mjs and wecom-cards.mjs: subscribe,
    ping, req_id replies, proactive sends and template-card events.
  - ds-bot/src/host/im/platforms/qq.js follows the gateway opcodes and
    message fields of @tencent-connect/qqbot-nodejs
    (https://github.com/tencent-connect/qqbot-nodejs, MIT): app access
    token, hello/heartbeat/identify/resume/reconnect/invalid session,
    C2C and group @ events, passive replies with msg_id and msg_seq.
  - ds-bot/src/host/im/platforms/dingtalk.js follows the stream frames of
    dingtalk-stream (https://github.com/alibaba-dingtalk/dingtalk-stream-nodejs,
    MIT): connections/open, ACKs by messageId, system pings, sessionWebhook
    and the robot OpenAPI fallback.
  - ds-bot/src/host/im/platforms/feishu.js follows the long-connection
    pbbp2 frame protocol of @larksuiteoapi/node-sdk
    (https://github.com/larksuite/node-sdk, MIT): the protobuf frame shape,
    ping/pong, data-frame ACKs with biz_rt, and split-payload reassembly.
  - ds-bot/src/client/im-page.js renders the pairing code with
    qrcode-generator (https://github.com/kazuhikoarase/qrcode-generator,
    MIT, Copyright (c) Kazuhiko Arase).

